# What `vercel deploy` must not upload from this directory.
#
# The CLI uploads the working directory, and verify.mjs leaves a 151 MB
# throwaway Chrome profile here (cdp-profile/) plus its screenshots. Uploading
# those failed the deploy outright with "fetch failed" before the build even
# started. .gitignore does not cover the CLI, so it is repeated here.
node_modules
dist
cdp-profile
dash_*.png
test
.vercel
.DS_Store
